---
import SectionContainer from "@/components/SectionContainer.astro";
---

<SectionContainer
  id="cta-soluciones"
  class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 pb-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"
>
  <div class="grid items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr]">
    <div
      class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-4xl border border-[#dfe7ee] bg-slate-900 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)]"
    >
      <div
        class="h-80 w-full bg-cover bg-center"
        style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-[#020b12]/80 via-[#020b12]/20 to-transparent"
      >
      </div>
      <p
        class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 text-lg font-medium italic text-white md:text-xl"
      >
        “Transformamos el caos técnico en eficiencia operativa medible.”
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:pl-3">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-[#260700] sm:text-4xl lg:text-[3rem]"
      >
        ¿Listo para estabilizar su infraestructura?
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-[#4b5563] sm:text-lg">
        Nuestros especialistas realizan una auditoría exhaustiva de sus sistemas
        actuales para identificar riesgos antes de que se conviertan en
        interrupciones de servicio.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/524423765296?text=Hola%2C%20me%20interesa%20solicitar%20una%20auditor%C3%ADa%20de%20infraestructura.%20Me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20recibir%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20el%20servicio."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-transparent bg-[#4b39d9] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_8px_20px_rgba(75,57,217,0.25)] transition hover:bg-[#402ed1]"
        >
          Solicitar Auditoría
        </a>
        <a
          href="#"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#d5d7dd] bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#1f2937] transition hover:border-[#a8b0c4] hover:bg-slate-50"
        >
          Ver Casos de Éxito
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</SectionContainer>
